  "description": "Stock Market Update + Stop Chasing Candles...Chase Setups!",
  "body_html": "<p>Stock market update: The stock market went up. </p><p>Pretty obvious!</p><p>Should we get excited? Maybe…but STOP CHASING CANDLES, are <em><strong>chase great setups</strong></em>…where the odds are in your favor. We have free education on <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-breakout-blueprint-by-timothy?r=4z8lgl\">how to trade breakouts</a>, and an entire free class where I teach <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/chart-structure-class?r=4z8lgl\">chart setups</a>. Check those out…you did not miss anything today…but you may miss out in the future! Please check those out, just in case we are starting the blow off top, which is highly profitable.</p><p>I will now be going through the stocks that gave buy signals today, and developing trading plans around those. Questions are always welcome in the chat 👇</p><p>Thanks for stopping by 👍</p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Want regular stock market updates? Consider subscribing for more information!</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p></p>",
